{"title":"Lizper Torso","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Armor Smithing Lv 56) · Monster drop: Warchief Ruk Gorehand, Old Mother Ashka, Ogre Butcher, Kragg The Unmoved</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Armor Smithing at level 56 <span class=\"muted\">(8719 XP)</span> from 8× <a href=\"#/item/titanium-bar\">Titanium Bar</a>, 2× <a href=\"#/item/lizper-scale\">Lizper Scale</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-warchief\" title=\"Warchief Ruk Gorehand - dropped it in 1 of 16 looted corpses (1/16)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9fdec8d1ac3c9d7ac8df.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Warchief Ruk Gorehand</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/16<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-firespeaker\" title=\"Old Mother Ashka - dropped it in 1 of 16 looted corpses (1/16)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c9d4aa1be4f688f3b580.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Old Mother Ashka</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/16<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-unmoved\" title=\"Kragg The Unmoved - dropped it in 1 of 16 looted corpses (1/16)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/0dd1fe765b90d83e2fba.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Kragg The Unmoved</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/16<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - dropped it in 1 of 215 looted corpses (1/215)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/215<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"lizper-torso\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/armor-smithing\">Armor smithing</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/titanium-bar\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/1f1604dc88f4e382bd7e.svg\" alt=\"\">Titanium Bar</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/lizper-scale\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/b79092ee4a292010c666.svg\" alt=\"\">Lizper Scale</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/46936312b236333fa7be.svg\" alt=\"Lizper Torso\"></div><h3>Lizper Torso</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Armor Smithing 56</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>4 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/22/2026, 2:59:57 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}